  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Mo Yao once found a spring dream fruit tree near a nameless hamlet and left it in place. The tree is not a desolate plant and looks ordinary, so most Gu Immortals would miss it. It is not an immortal material. Retrieving spring dream fruits needs special dream path methods and other preparations. If spring dream fruits exist, they help greatly in refining dream path mortal Gu, whose materials are truly scarce, and even a conservative estimation multiplies the efficiency of that refinement.",
      "chapters": [
        887
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "scarce-dream-path-material",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_mo_yao",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_dream_path_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A true spring dream fruit tree exists in dreams and has no material body. It needs a real ancient tree as foundation to live long, and nearby humans’ dreams from generation after generation nourish it. Fang Yuan cannot pick the spring dream fruits until he refines dream path mortal Gu targeted at picking them.",
      "chapters": [
        973
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-tree-and-harvest-limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He continuously refines dream path mortal Gu and uses those Gu to pick up large numbers of spring dream fruits from the village tree.",
      "chapters": [
        976
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "large-harvest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A month of that work collects all of the spring dream fruits and refines a large number of dream path mortal Gu, more than in his previous life.",
      "chapters": [
        980
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "large-harvest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Collecting the spring dream fruits gives him immense returns when he expends dream path mortal Gu to use Unravel Dream again and again.",
      "chapters": [
        1006
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unravel-dream-stockpile",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_unravel_dream"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has harvested the fruits of that Central Continent spring dream fruit tree, and they helped him greatly.",
      "chapters": [
        1232
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "harvest-recalled",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He compares other dream path work to an earlier time when using spring dream fruit to refine mortal Gu gave great efficiency.",
      "chapters": [
        1293
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
